    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, kick, and dive your way through <strong>Blinding Lite</strong>! Explore a wide world full of colorful characters and levels washed in <strong>8-BIT</strong> glory! Take control of Lite, the loveable ghostly crow on a mission to save the Elementals, godly beings who have been captured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the source of the Fragments, and set them free! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961210/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.poster.avif?t=1755355500\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961210/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.webm?t=1755355500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961210/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.mp4?t=1755355500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blinding Lite is tuned for maximum momentum building and acrobatic movement that ties right into the combat. Any movement ability doubles as an attack of some sort! From diving beak-first into your enemies or a swift kick from above, the combat will always keep you on the move!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, kick, and dive your way through <strong>Blinding Lite</strong>! Explore a wide world full of colorful characters and levels washed in <strong>8-BIT</strong> glory! Take control of Lite, the loveable ghostly crow on a mission to save the Elementals, godly beings who have been captured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the source of the Fragments, and set them free! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961210/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.poster.avif?t=1755355500\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961210/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.webm?t=1755355500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961210/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.mp4?t=1755355500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blinding Lite is tuned for maximum momentum building and acrobatic movement that ties right into the combat. Any movement ability doubles as an attack of some sort! From diving beak-first into your enemies or a swift kick from above, the combat will always keep you on the move!</p>",
    "short_description": "Blinding Lite is an action-adventure platformer that focuses on tight acrobatic platforming. Venture forth and save the Elementals from their capture! Experience a flowing move set, a world brimming with character, and a world painted in NES colors!",
